VALUES
('alict_00501', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'What was a key limitation of first-generation computers compared to later generations?', '["Lack of stored program capability", "Inability to perform basic arithmetic operations", "High reliance on mechanical components", "Use of transistors instead of vacuum tubes", "Integration of artificial intelligence algorithms"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Option 1: First-generation computers primarily relied on hardwired meaning instructions had to be manually configured using switches or punched cards. They did not have the concept of a stored which was introduced later with the von Neumann architecture', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 2027, 501, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00502', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'In the context of data what does the term "batch processing" refer to?', '["Processing data in real-time as it is received", "Processing data in groups or batches", "Processing data using parallel computing techniques", "Processing data incrementally as new data arrives kj", "Processing data using cloud computing resources"]'::jsonb, 2, 'The correct answer is 2) Processing data in groups or batches. Batch processing refers to a method of data processing where data is grouped into and processed together as a single unit', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 2027, 502, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00503', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'Which of the following scenarios best demonstrates the "veracity" characteristic of big data?', '["A financial institution processing thousands of transactions per second to detect fraud in real-time", "A social media co mpany storing petabytes of user -generated including and messages", "A retail business analyzing customer purchase history , and web browsing behavior to recommend personalized products", "A healthcare provider using AI to analyze patient re cords and predict potential diseases for better treatment planning. frda.S", "A data analyst cleaning and verifying large datasets to remove inconsistencies before making business decisions"]'::jsonb, 5, 'The correct answer is 5) A data analyst cleaning and verifying large datasets to remove inconsistencies before making business decisions. This scenario demonstrates the "veracity" characteristic of big which refers to the and reliability of the data', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 2027, 503, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00504', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'Which of the following is an advanced use case of big data analytics?', '["Personalized product recommendations in e-commerce platforms", "Monitoring and controlling traffic lights in real time using devices", "Predicting disease outbreaks through analysis of health-related data. fi!LH", "Fraud detection in financial transactions using machine learning algorithms", "All of the above"]'::jsonb, 5, 'Big data has advanced applications across various uyd Option 1: E-commerce platforms use big data to analyze customer behavior and provide personalized recommendations. uyd Option 2: devices process real-time traffic data to optimize traffic light operations', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 2027, 504, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00505', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'Which of the following is NOT a component of Information and Communication Technology (ICT)?', '["Computers", "Networks", "Telecommunication systems", "Radio broadcasting", "Artificial Intelligence"]'::jsonb, 5, 'Correct answer: "Artificial Intelligence". This reflects the standard definition/impact of this concept in ICT and society.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 2027, 505, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00506', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'Which of the following is an example of phishing?', '["Sending deceptive emails to steal sensitive", "Copying software without a proper license", "Illegally downloading movies from the internet", "Selling counterfeit ICT hardware", "Sharing someone else''s work without proper attribution. ksis wdfrdamKhlska"]'::jsonb, 1, 'The question asks for an example of which is a cyber-attack designed to deceive individuals into providing sensitive information like credit card or personal data. Phishing typically involves fraudulent or websites pretending to be legitimate', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 2027, 506, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00507', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'Which of the following scenarios is an example of plagiarism?', '["Downloading a movie from an unauthorized website without paying. wkjir", "Copying someone else''s essay and submitting it as your own without giving credit", "Installing a single-user licensed software on multiple computers in your office", "Claiming ownership of another person''s intellectual property", "Sending phishing emails to collect sensitive user"]'::jsonb, 2, 'The correct answer is Option 2: " Copying someone else''s essay and submitting it as your own without giving credit', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 2027, 507, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00508', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'What is a major threat to businesses when managing privacy through ICT systems?', '["Increased customer feedback", "Enhanced product innovation", "Higher risk of unauthorized data access and privacy breaches wkjir", "Improved market analysis", "Streamlined supply chain management"]'::jsonb, 3, 'The major threat to businesses when managing privacy through ICT systems is 3) Higher risk of unauthorized data access and privacy breaches. m%Odk Unauthorized access to sensitive customer or business often referred to as data poses a significant risk', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 2027, 508, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00509', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'Which of the following actions is a violation of music copyright laws?', '["Downloading a song from a legal streaming service for offline listening. fkdne\u00a2", "Using a copyrighted song in a video without permission. wjirhlska", "Purchasing a physical music album and sharing it with friends for personal use", "Creating a cover version of a song and giving credit to the original artist", "None Above"]'::jsonb, 2, 'The correct answer is 2) Using a copyrighted song in a video without permission. This is a violation of music copyright laws because using someone else''s copyrighted work without proper authorization or licensing constitutes infringement', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 2027, 509, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00510', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'What is one major ethical issue associated with the advancement of ICT?', '["Economic inequality", "Phishing attacks", "Privacy invasion", "Increased e-waste", "Growth in the digital economy"]'::jsonb, 3, 'A major ethical issue associated with the advancement of ICT is the invasion of privacy. With the growing digital vast amounts of personal data are and stored by various ICT systems', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 2027, 510, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00511', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'Which term refers to the illegal copying and distribution of digital content?', '["Piracy", "Phishing", "Privacy invasion", "Licensing", "Digital divide"]'::jsonb, 1, 'Piracy is the term that refers to the illegal copying and distribution of digital content. It involves duplicating and sharing digital media like and other copyrighted materials without authorization from the content owner', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 2027, 511, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00512', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'Which of the following best describes "digital divide"?', '["A gap in access to digital technologies between different groups", "Increased security risks from ICT", "Illegal copying of digital content", "Lack of environmental regulations for ICT", "Challenges in licensing software"]'::jsonb, 1, 'The term "digital divide" refers to the gap in access to digital technologies between different such as those with differing socioeconomic geographic or educational levels', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 2027, 512, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00513', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'Use of sensitive such as a credit card for malicious purposes is called', '["Plagiarism", "Encryption", "Digital divide", "Intellectual Property Rights", "Phishing"]'::jsonb, 5, 'Phishing is the act of using sensitive such as passwords or credit card for malicious purposes', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 2027, 513, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00514', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'What is the primary environmental issue associated with ICT?', '["Plagiarism of digital content", "Invasion of privacy", "Disposal of electronic waste", "Economic inequality", "Cybersecurity threats"]'::jsonb, 3, 'The primary environmental issue associated with ICT is the disposal of electronic commonly referred to as e-waste. As technology rapidly older devices become leading to large amounts of discarded electronics', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 2027, 514, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00515', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'Which How does cloud computing enhance ICT services ?', '["By limiting user access to applications", "By providing improved and availability of information", "By reducing the availability of resources", "By making data access slower", "By decreasing the use of mobile applications. cx.u"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Correct answer: "By providing improved and availability of information". This reflects the standard definition/impact of this concept in ICT and society.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 2027, 515, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00516', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'What aspect of ICT directly contributes to enhancing information dissemination worldwide?', '["Limited access to data", "Increased availability of cloud computing services", "Restricted access to mobile applications. cx.u", "Increased manual processing of information", "Exclusive reliance on printed materials"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Correct answer: "Increased availability of cloud computing services". This reflects the standard definition/impact of this concept in ICT and society.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 2027, 516, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00517', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'Which of the following statements about the digital divide is NOT true?', '["The digital divide refers to the gap in access to digital technology and internet services between different demographics", "The digital divide only exists in underdeveloped countries and does not affect developed nations", "Economic inequality is a key factor contributing to the digital divide", "Closing the digital divide is one of the goals outlined in the Sustainable Development Goals", "The digital divide can impact access to job and social"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Correct answer: "The digital divide only exists in underdeveloped countries and does not affect developed nations". This reflects the standard definition/impact of this concept in ICT and society.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 2027, 517, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00518', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'Which of the following best represents an ethical concern associated with ICT usage?', '["ICT provides improved business efficiency and productivity. ICT", "Increased ICT usage has led to a reduction in the global digital divide. ICT", "ICT advancements can lead to the invasion of user privacy without consent. ICT wjirhlska", "Legal frameworks ensure all ICT resources are ethically used. ICT", "ICT promotes global reducing ethical concerns. ICT"]'::jsonb, 3, 'Correct answer: "ICT advancements can lead to the invasion of user privacy without consent. ICT wjirhlska". This reflects the standard definition/impact of this concept in ICT and society.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 2027, 518, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00519', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'Which statement best describes the purpose of intellectual property laws in ICT?', '["To prevent the environmental impact of e-waste", "To reduce economic inequality caused by ICT ksid", "To protect the rights of creators and prevent unauthorized use or distribution of digital content", "To increase access to ICT resources in developing countries", "To regulate the use of social media platforms iudc"]'::jsonb, 3, 'Correct answer: "To protect the rights of creators and prevent unauthorized use or distribution of digital content". This reflects the standard definition/impact of this concept in ICT and society.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 2027, 519, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00520', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'Which was invented in the third generation?', '["Vacuum tubes", "Transistors g%dkaisiagr", "Microprocessors ilik", "Artificial Intelligence", "Integrated Circuits"]'::jsonb, 5, 'The generations and their inventions are as • Vacuum tubes - first generation • Transistors - second generation g%dkaisiagr - fojk • Integrated Circuits - third generation • Microprocessors - fourth generation ilik - • Artificial Intelligence - fifth generation', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 2027, 520, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00521', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'What is the correct statement regarding the impact of ICT on society?', '["ICT has primarily economic benefits with minimal social impact. ICT wju iudc", "ICT can raise issues of data leading to risks like phishing and unauthorized access. ICT u.ska", "Licensed and unlicensed software usage does not impact businesses", "Copyright laws are unnecessary in managing ICT resources. ICT", "ICT does not influence sustainable development goals. ICT"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Correct answer: "ICT can raise issues of data leading to risks like phishing and unauthorized access. ICT u.ska". This reflects the standard definition/impact of this concept in ICT and society.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 2027, 521, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00522', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'Which of the following represents an ethical issue related to ICT ?', '["Increased online collaboration", "Loss of traditional jobs", "Data privacy concerns in cloud applications", "Improved access to global information", "Introduction of e-commerce platforms"]'::jsonb, 3, 'Ethical issues in ICT often revolve around challenges like data and the misuse of information. Concerns about protecting personal or sensitive data in cloud applications directly relate to ethical as they impact trust and user rights', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 2027, 522, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00523', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'Which of the following is a typical indicator of a phishing attempt in an email?', '["The email contains a verified sender''s name and official domain", "The email is professionally written with no spelling or grammatical errors", "The email requests personal information or clicking a suspicious link", "The email contains no attachments or links", "The email uses secure encryption methods for transmission"]'::jsonb, 3, 'Phishing emails often aim to deceive users into sharing personal information like or credit card details. Let''s go through the given options Option 1: Incorrect. Phishers can spoof official sender names and making it not a reliable indicator of phishing', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 2027, 523, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00524', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'What is phishing in the context of ICT?', '["A legal method of software distribution", "Unauthorized duplication of copyrighted content", "A form of cyber attack that tricks individuals into providing sensitive information", "An environmental issue related to e-waste", "A benefit of online education"]'::jsonb, 3, 'Option 1: This option is incorrect because phishing is not related to the legal distribution of software. Legal methods of software distribution involve authorized channels and compliance with copyright which have no connection to phishing', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 2027, 524, '2027 Quiz Series'),
