('alict_00526', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'A small startup company uses Microsoft Azure to host its virtual and networking infrastructure. What type of cloud computing service does it primarily use?', '["(Software as a Service)", "(Platform as a Service)", "(Infrastructure as a Service)", "(Function as a Service)", "(Data as a Service)"]'::jsonb, 3, 'Microsoft Azure provides virtual and networking which means the startup is using raw computing resources like virtual and networks', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 2027, 526, '2027 Quiz Series'),
('alict_00527', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'Which of the following correctly lists the chronological order of computing generations based on their primary technology?', '["Vacuum Tubes \u2192 Transistors \u2192 Integrated Circuits \u2192 Microprocessors \u2192 Artificial Intelligence", "Transistors \u2192 Vacuum Tubes \u2192 Microprocessors \u2192 Integrated Circuits \u2192 Quantum Computing g%dkaisiagr \u2192", "Vacuum Tubes \u2192 Integrated Circuits \u2192 Transistors \u2192 Microprocessors \u2192 Quantum Computing", "Integrated Circuits \u2192 Vacuum Tubes \u2192 Transistors \u2192 Microprocessors \u2192 Artificial Intelligence", "Vacuum Tubes \u2192 Transistors \u2192 Microprocessors \u2192 Integrated Circuits \u2192 Quantum Computing"]'::jsonb, 1, '• First Generation Vacuum Tubes • Second Generation Transistors • Third Generation Integrated Circuits • Fourth Generation Microprocessors • Fifth Generation Artificial Intelligence Systems (ongoing development', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 2027, 527, '2027 Quiz Series'),
