('alict_00529', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'Which of the following is a key feature of fifth-generation computers?', '["Use of vacuum tubes", "Use of transistors g%dkaisiagr", "Use of integrated circuits", "Use of Very Large Scale Integration circuits", "Use of Artificial Intelligence and Ultra Large Scale Integration"]'::jsonb, 5, 'Option 1: Incorrect. Vacuum tubes were the primary hardware technology used in first-generation computers. Option 2: Incorrect. Transistors replaced vacuum tubes in second-generation computers. g%dkaisiagr Option 3: Incorrect', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 2027, 529, '2027 Quiz Series'),
