('alict_00532', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'Which of the following was a major development in computing during the 1990s?', '["The invention of the microprocessor", "The creation of the internet", "The development of the personal computer", "The widespread adoption of cloud computing", "The introduction of artificial intelligence"]'::jsonb, 2, 'The invention of the microprocessor This was a significant development in the not the 1990s. 1990 2) The creation of the internet The as we know it began to take shape in the 1990s with the widespread adoption of the World Wide Web. wo wm okakd yev', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 2027, 532, '2027 Quiz Series'),
