('alict_00534', 11, 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 'Why is the use of strong and unique passwords crucial in protecting against cyber attacks?', '["Strong passwords prevent opening emails containing cyberattacks", "Strong passwords help reduce the risk of account compromise if cyber attack occurs. uqrmo\"", "Strong passwords ensure automatic detection of websites with cyber attacks", "Unique passwords guarantee that no one will attempt cyber attacks", "Strong passwords encrypt sensitive data making cyber attacks impossible"]'::jsonb, 2, 'The use of strong and unique passwords is crucial in protecting against cyberattacks because they help reduce the risk of account compromise if a cyberattack occurs', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'ICT & Society, Security, E-commerce', 2027, 534, '2027 Quiz Series'),
