('alict_00585', 1, 'Introduction to ICT & Data/Information', 'Which of the following is a good example of real-time processing?', '["Library book check-out system", "Automated stock market trading system", "Daily website traffic analytics", "Monthly sales report generation", "Yearly tax report preparation"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Real-time processing refers to systems that respond immediately to input and produce instant results. Let''s review each option. Option 1: This system processes data instantly when a book is checked out. it doesn''t require the strict timing that real-time processing demands', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Introduction to ICT & Data/Information', 2027, 585, '2027 Quiz Series'),
