('alict_00749', 2, 'Number Systems & Data Representation', 'Which of the following statements is true about 2''s complement?', '["Used in first generation computers to perform logical operations", "Addition and subtraction are two different operations", "An extra bit is used to represent the sign", "It helps to develop cheaper hardware to perform arithmetic operations. wxl", "Usually represented by the hexadecimal number system"]'::jsonb, 4, '2''s complement is widely used in computer systems to represent signed integers. One of its key advantages is that it allows the same hardware circuits to be used for both addition and simplifying the design and making it faster and cheaper to implement. 2', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Number Systems & Data Representation', 2027, 749, '2027 Quiz Series'),
