('alict_00751', 2, 'Number Systems & Data Representation', 'Which of the following numbers is equivalent to the binary number 11010100 2 represented in two''s complement form?', '["52", "-44", "74", "78", "68"]'::jsonb, 2, 'To determine which of the given numbers is equivalent to the binary number 11010100 2 represented in two''s complement we can follow these ,nd i. Verify the most significant bit (MSB) of the binary number. If it is 1, it indicates a negative number. ii', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Number Systems & Data Representation', 2027, 751, '2027 Quiz Series'),
