('alict_00898', 4, 'Computer Systems & Architecture', 'Which type of RAM is faster and used as cache memory?', '["DRAM", "SRAM", "SDRAM", "VRAM", "DDR4"]'::jsonb, 2, 'DRAM (Dynamic RAM) - Wrong Answer Used as main system memory (RAM). m%Odk Slower than SRAM because it requires constant refreshing to maintain data. SRAM Commonly found in computers and mobile devices as primary RAM. cx.u 2', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Computer Systems & Architecture', NULL, 898, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_00899', 4, 'Computer Systems & Architecture', 'A computer has three RAM drives. They run at a clock speed of and 4800MHz respectively. In which clock speed will the RAM system run at?', '["5600 MHz", "4800 MHz", "4600 MHz", "4200 MHz", "3200 MHz"]'::jsonb, 5, 'When you mix RAM your computer runs at the speed of the slowest RAM Tn RAM 1. Synchronization is key. All parts of your RAM system must work together at the same speed for data to transfer correctly. 2. Memory controllers are simple', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Computer Systems & Architecture', NULL, 899, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
